      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUPER SKUNK (1) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, finishing in the money last time when 2nd at this track over 300m. Got the money at his only try from this box. Can measure up this time. BARRELLED (7) carved over from wide out and boxed on strongly to finish 1.5 lengths away in second (17.56) behind Redeem A Arcadia at this track. Bold showing expected. SPITFIRE GEORGE (2) produced a moderate run last time when fifth at this track over 300m behind Redeem A Arcadia (18.03) in a Grade 4/5. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings two times from three attempts. Will give the top chances plenty to think about. SUNDOWN (3) will be thereabouts while fresh. Something for the Multiples: LITTLE BEAST (8)",
